    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <i>Plague Doctor</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An action roguelite where plague is not the only thing that spreads...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the mask of the Plague Doctor, a lone warrior on the brink of discovering the source of a horrific plague that devours all life. The cure is not mercy \u2014 it\u2019s destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enter the journey mid-hunt. Your path begins in a cursed village, where goblins and their brutal orc leader spread fear and decay. From there, descend into ancient catacombs teeming with undead skeletons, risen from their tombs and commanded by a necromantic Lich. Your final descent leads to a rotting swamp, where the true source of the plague hides \u2014 a nightmarish creature never seen before, commanding a horde of corrupted abominations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Gameplay Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <i>Toxin Gauntlet Combat</i> \u2013 Melt enemies in close quarters with alchemical melee attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 <i>Elemental Crossbow</i> \u2013 Switch between poison, fire, and frost bolts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddb <i>Boss Transformations</i> \u2013 Absorb the blood of fallen bosses and become them \u2014 briefly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f <i>Dark Biomes</i> \u2013 Fight through cursed villages, crypts, and toxic swamps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2620\ufe0f <i>Toxin System</i> \u2013 Power comes with a cost \u2014 overdose and die horribly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <i>Atmospheric Lore</i> \u2013 Discover the truth behind the plague through hidden texts and encounters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track the plague. Become the cure. Or fall to the rot.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <i>Plague Doctor</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An action roguelite where plague is not the only thing that spreads...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the mask of the Plague Doctor, a lone warrior on the brink of discovering the source of a horrific plague that devours all life. The cure is not mercy \u2014 it\u2019s destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enter the journey mid-hunt. Your path begins in a cursed village, where goblins and their brutal orc leader spread fear and decay. From there, descend into ancient catacombs teeming with undead skeletons, risen from their tombs and commanded by a necromantic Lich. Your final descent leads to a rotting swamp, where the true source of the plague hides \u2014 a nightmarish creature never seen before, commanding a horde of corrupted abominations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Gameplay Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <i>Toxin Gauntlet Combat</i> \u2013 Melt enemies in close quarters with alchemical melee attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 <i>Elemental Crossbow</i> \u2013 Switch between poison, fire, and frost bolts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddb <i>Boss Transformations</i> \u2013 Absorb the blood of fallen bosses and become them \u2014 briefly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f <i>Dark Biomes</i> \u2013 Fight through cursed villages, crypts, and toxic swamps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2620\ufe0f <i>Toxin System</i> \u2013 Power comes with a cost \u2014 overdose and die horribly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <i>Atmospheric Lore</i> \u2013 Discover the truth behind the plague through hidden texts and encounters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track the plague. Become the cure. Or fall to the rot.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Become the cure. Hunt the plague. Die trying.Plague Doctor is an action roguelite where you purge a dying world of monstrous corruption. Battle goblins, liches, and eldritch horrors using toxins, alchemical crossbows, and forbidden transformations. The cure is violence.",
